// GHOSTBAND - GP5 follows each song's tempo.
//
// Electric Sunburst (and any other pattern instrument) plays in GP5's tempo,
// not Ghostband's. Ghostband publishes the loaded song's tempo as its host
// parameter 0 ("Song tempo", 20-300 BPM); this script copies it into GP5's
// tempo whenever it changes, and when the rackspace opens.
//
// ONE-TIME SETUP (in the rackspace that holds Ghostband):
//   1. Right-click Ghostband's block > Properties: set its GPScript name
//      (the "Handle") to Ghostband, and tick "Use in GPScript".
//   2. Window > Edit Rackspace Script: paste this whole file, click Compile,
//      then save the gig.
//
// Ghostband only publishes the tempo while "plan tempo" is on - with it off,
// GP5's own tempo is the one in charge and nothing here changes it.

Var Ghostband : PluginBlock

// Ghostband's normalised value back to BPM: 20 + value * 280.
On ParameterValueChanged(index : Integer, value : Double) from Ghostband
    If index == 0 Then
        SetBPM(20.0 + value * 280.0)
    End
End

On Activate
    SetBPM(20.0 + GetParameter(Ghostband, 0) * 280.0)
End
